## Git safety (critical)

- **Working tree wins** over last commit for in-progress refactors (hooks, Phase B/C).
- **Never** run `git checkout`, `git restore`, or `git reset` on builder files unless the user explicitly asks to discard changes.
- Before any git operation that touches `app/page.tsx`, `components/builder/`, or `lib/builder/`, run `git status` and warn if it would destroy uncommitted work.
- Do not assume `git show HEAD:…` is current — check the file on disk first.

